<title>UK: World Bank adds 150 mln rand to one-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank adds 150 mln rand to one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been</p>
<p>increased to 550 million rand from 400 million rand lead manager</p>
<p>Hambros Bank said.</p>
<p>BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p>AMT   *550 MLN ZAR   COUPON     15.25     MATURITY    10.JUN.98</p>
<p>TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.75    PAY DATE    10.JUN.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/GB/ZA</p>
<p>NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.10</p>
<p>NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 06.MAY.97 AND INCREASED ON</p>
<p>07.MAY.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
